---
// עמוד סיפור בספרדית — אותו מבנה כמו העברי: תווית עולם, כותרת, שער, גוף,
// שיתוף, קבוצה (אם יש קישור), ותחתית עם סיפור אקראי.
// בלי WriteToMe: ההזמנה לשיחה פרטית היא בעברית בלבד (החלטה מתועדת).
import { getCollection, render } from 'astro:content';
import { Image, getImage } from 'astro:assets';
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
import ShareRow from '../../../components/ShareRow.astro';
import JoinGroup from '../../../components/JoinGroup.astro';
import NextUp from '../../../components/NextUp.astro';
import { SECTIONS_ES } from '../../../data/site-es';
const SECTIONS_ES_LABELS = Object.fromEntries(Object.entries(SECTIONS_ES).map(([k, v]) => [k, v.label]));
import { DEFAULT_COVERS, DEFAULT_COVER_ALT_ES } from '../../../data/default-covers';
import { formatDate } from '../../../utils/format-date';
import { articleJsonLd, breadcrumbJsonLd } from '../../../lib/structured-data';
import { isPublished } from '../../../lib/published';
import { newestFirst } from '../../../lib/sort';
import { nextStories, momentForStory } from '../../../lib/related';
import { readingLabel as readingLabelFor } from '../../../lib/reading-time';

export async function getStaticPaths() {
  const stories = await getCollection('storiesEs', isPublished);
  return stories.map((story) => ({
    params: { slug: story.id },
    props: { story },
  }));
}

const { story } = Astro.props;
const { Content } = await render(story);
const { title, section, date, excerpt } = story.data;

const readingLabel = readingLabelFor(story, 'es');
const cover = story.data.cover ?? DEFAULT_COVERS[section];
const coverAlt = story.data.coverAlt ?? DEFAULT_COVER_ALT_ES;

const pageUrl = new URL(`/es/historias/${story.id}/`, Astro.site).href;

let ogImage: string | undefined;
let ogImageWidth: number | undefined;
let ogImageHeight: number | undefined;
if (cover.format !== 'svg') {
  const og = await getImage({ src: cover, width: 1200, format: 'jpeg' });
  ogImage = new URL(og.src, Astro.site).href;
  ogImageWidth = og.attributes.width;
  ogImageHeight = og.attributes.height;
}

const allStories = (await getCollection('storiesEs', isPublished)).sort(newestFirst);
const otherStoryUrls = allStories.filter((s) => s.id !== story.id).map((s) => `/es/historias/${s.id}/`);
// "ההמשך" (NextUp) בספרדית: הקרבה התוכנית נמדדת דרך התאום העברי (התגיות
// חיות שם), והמועמדים והרגע — רק מה שקיים בספרדית ("מבחר ולא מראה").
const hebrewStories = await getCollection('stories', isPublished);
const nextCandidates = nextStories(story, allStories, SECTIONS_ES_LABELS, hebrewStories);
const relatedMoment = momentForStory(story, await getCollection('momentsEs', isPublished), hebrewStories);
---

<Base
  lang="es"
  title={`${title} · Punto de Vista`}
  description={excerpt}
  ogType="article"
  ogImage={ogImage}
  ogImageWidth={ogImageWidth}
  ogImageHeight={ogImageHeight}
  compact={true}
  altLangHref={`/stories/${story.id}/`}
  jsonLd={[
    articleJsonLd(Astro.site!, {
      url: pageUrl,
      headline: title,
      description: excerpt,
      datePublished: date,
      image: ogImage,
      inLanguage: 'es',
    }),
    breadcrumbJsonLd(Astro.site!, [
      { name: 'Punto de Vista', path: '/es/' },
      { name: 'Historias', path: '/es/historias/' },
      { name: SECTIONS_ES[section].label, path: `/es/secciones/${section}/` },
      { name: title },
    ]),
  ]}
>
  <main>
    <article>
      <header class="story-header">
        <a class="label" href={`/es/secciones/${section}/`}>{SECTIONS_ES[section].label}</a>
        <h1>{title}</h1>
        <p class="story-meta">
          <time datetime={date.toISOString().slice(0, 10)}>{formatDate(date, 'es')}</time>
          <span aria-hidden="true"> · </span>
          <span>{readingLabel}</span>
        </p>
      </header>
      <Image src={cover} alt={coverAlt} widths={[480, 800, 1200]} sizes="(max-width: 42rem) 100vw, 42rem" class="cover" />
      <div class="story-body">
        <Content />
      </div>
      <span class="end-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </article>

    <ShareRow title={title} url={pageUrl} lang="es" />
    <NextUp current={story.id} candidates={nextCandidates} moment={relatedMoment} lang="es" />
    <JoinGroup lang="es" />

    <nav class="story-footer">
      <a href="/es/historias/">Ver las {allStories.length} historias</a>
      {otherStoryUrls.length > 0 && <button id="random-story" type="button" data-ph="random_story">Una historia al azar</button>}
    </nav>
  </main>
</Base>

{
  otherStoryUrls.length > 0 && (
    <script is:inline define:vars={{ otherStoryUrls }}>
      document.getElementById('random-story').addEventListener('click', () => {
        // Al azar entre lo que aún no se leyó (memoria de lectura de NextUp); si ya se leyó todo, entre todas.
        let read = [];
        try {
          read = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('nm_read') ?? '[]');
        } catch {}
        const unread = otherStoryUrls.filter((url) => !read.includes(url.split('/')[3]));
        const pool = unread.length > 0 ? unread : otherStoryUrls;
        location.href = pool[Math.floor(Math.random() * pool.length)];
      });
    </script>
  )
}

<style>
  .story-header {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 0.5rem 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .story-header h1 {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 6.5vw, 2.5rem);
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin: 0.85rem 0 0.5rem;
  }

  .story-meta {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .cover {
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
  }

  .story-body {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 2.05;
  }

  .story-body :global(p + p) {
    margin-top: 1.35rem;
  }

  .story-body :global(blockquote) {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    color: var(--teal-deep);
    border-inline-start: 3px solid var(--gold);
    padding-inline-start: 1.1rem;
    margin: 1.75rem 0;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  /* בעברית ההדגשה היא משקל במקום נטייה; בספרדית נטייה טבעית, אבל נשמרת
     אותה שפה חזותית של האתר — משקל וצבע, כדי ששני האזורים ייראו זהים. */
  .story-body :global(em) {
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--teal-deep);
  }

  .story-body :global(.signature) {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    color: var(--teal-deep);
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .end-dot {
    display: block;
    width: 0.55rem;
    height: 0.55rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--gold);
    margin: 2.75rem auto 0;
  }

  .story-footer {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  /* שקט ואפור: כרטיס "הסיפור הבא" הוא ההצעה; אלה דלתות למי שרוצה את המפה. */
  .story-footer a,
  .story-footer button {
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    background: none;
    border: none;
    padding: 0;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.25em;
    font-weight: 500;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .story-footer a:hover,
  .story-footer button:hover {
    color: var(--teal);
  }
</style>
